      "title": "Claude + Blender MCP: When AI Starts Controlling the Real Tool",
      "preview_text": "Most people still treat AI in 3D as a generator of pretty pictures.\nThat is the narrowest possible reading of what is happening.\nWhen Claude is connected to Blender through MCP, it does not produce a",
      "cover_media": {
        "id": "QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHOuhJ0kWIAAKAAIXCmbsTFZwAwAA",
        "media_id": "2083936442690969600",
        "media_info": {
          "__typename": "ApiImage",
          "color_info": {
            "palette": [
              {
                "percentage": 81.69,
